#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2206 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "Boundary between 'record absent' and 'record present but value empty': the TSPARMCD='RANDOM' record exists but TSVAL is empty and the null flavor is declared in TSVALNF - the record-vs-value boundary: the rule checks record PRESENCE, an empty TSVAL still counts."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
col TSVALNF  type=Char label="Parameter Null Flavor"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 1 | TITLE  | Trial Title                | A Randomized Study of Drug X |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 2 | TPHASE | Trial Phase Classification | PHASE III TRIAL              |
CDISCPILOT01 | TS | 3 | RANDOM | Trial is Randomized |  | NA
